<BLOCKQUOTE>
Brokers
In this section you will use a Search String method for selecting eligible Brokers.  For example, let’s suppose you want to find Lott Marketing in Dallas.  You have a couple options for conducting the search.  You can either enter “lott” or “dallas” in the Search String window.  From there, you can individually check the Lott brokers that serve Dallas, or if everyone in your search is eligible, click the box in the upper left hand corner of your Search Results table (orange bar) to check all.  You also have the option to Select All Brokers (once again, only if ALL your brokers are eligible) by putting a check mark in the associated box.  After you have finished selecting the your Brokers, click the “Save” button.  
</BLOCKQUOTE>
